- Adding `bridge` requires: (1) add to `KNOWN_GROUPS`, (2) add `case 'bridge':` in `routeGrouped()`, (3) create `scripts/bridge/` handler module
- `run-envelope.mjs` provides `makeEnvelope()` / `normalizeEnvelope()` / `writeRunSummary()` — already writes to `<ResearchVaultRoot>/99_System/run_summaries/`
- `run-ledger.mjs` tracks `run_id`, `date`, `cadence` per orchestrated run — `run_id` already exists in the ledger system
